msgstr "Selang Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php:1250
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Kekerapan pengumpul data Cacti akan dimulakan.  Anda boleh menggunakan crontab, tugas berjadual (untuk windows), atau perkhidmatan systemd cactid untuk mengawal pelancaran pengumpul data Cacti.  Untuk arahan menggunakan daemon cactid, rujuk fail README.md dalam direktori service."

#: include/global_settings.php:1256
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Imbangkan Beban Proses"

#: include/global_settings.php:1257
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Jika anda memilih pilihan ini, Cacti akan cuba mengimbangi beban setiap proses poller dengan mengagihkan item poller secara sama rata bagi setiap proses."

#: include/global_settings.php:1262
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Lebar Output Nyahpepijat"

#: include/global_settings.php:1263
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Jika anda memilih pilihan ini, Cacti akan menyemak output yang melebihi keupayaan Cacti untuk menyimpannya dan mengeluarkan amaran apabila ia ditemui."

#: include/global_settings.php:1268
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Lumpuhkan Semakan OID Meningkat"

#: include/global_settings.php:1269
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Mengawal pelumpuhan semakan OID meningkat semasa melalui pokok OID."

#: include/global_settings.php:1274
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa Ejen Jauh"

#: include/global_settings.php:1275
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Tempoh masa, dalam saat, pelayan web Cacti Pusat akan menunggu respons daripada Pengumpul Data Jauh untuk mendapatkan pelbagai maklumat Peranti sebelum meninggalkan permintaan.  Pada Peranti yang dikaitkan dengan Pengumpul Data selain Pengumpul Data Cacti Pusat, Ejen Jauh mesti digunakan untuk mengumpul maklumat Peranti."

#: include/global_settings.php:1288
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Saiz Ambil SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php:1289
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Berapa banyak OID yang patut dikembalikan bagi setiap permintaan snmpbulkwalk?  Bagi Peranti dengan pokok SNMP yang besar, menaikkan saiz ini akan meningkatkan prestasi pengindeksan semula melalui WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php:1308
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Had OID SNMP Get"

#: include/global_settings.php:1309
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Bilangan maksimum lalai OID SNMP Get yang dikeluarkan bagi setiap permintaan snmpget.  Bagi Peranti, tetapan ini dikawal pada peringkat Peranti.  Anda hanya patut menggunakan tetapan ini apabila menggunakan API SNMP Cacti secara natif dalam skrip atau pemalam anda."

#: include/global_settings.php:1316
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Lumpuhkan Replikasi Cache Sumber"

#: include/global_settings.php:1317
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Secara lalai, Pengumpul Data Cacti utama akan menyimpan cache seluruh laman web dan pemalam ke dalam Cache Sumber.  Kemudian, secara berkala Pengumpul Data Jauh akan mengemas kini diri mereka dengan sebarang kemas kini daripada Pengumpul Data Cacti utama.  Cache Sumber ini pada dasarnya membolehkan Pengumpul Data Jauh menaik taraf sendiri.  Jika anda tidak mahu menggunakan pilihan ini, anda boleh melumpuhkannya menggunakan tetapan ini."

#: include/global_settings.php:1322
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Pengumpul Data Tambahan"

#: include/global_settings.php:1327
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Pengelogan Data Tidak Sah"

#: include/global_settings.php:1328
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Bagaimanakah anda mahu ralat output Pengumpul Data dilog?  Pilihan termasuk: 'Terperinci' yang memperincikan setiap ralat, 'Ringkasan' yang menyediakan bilangan ralat output bagi setiap Peranti, dan 'Tiada', yang tidak menyediakan kiraan ralat."

#: include/global_settings.php:1333 utilities.php:180
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Ringkasan"

#: include/global_settings.php:1334
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Terperinci"

#: include/global_settings.php:1338
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Bilangan Pelayan Skrip PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php:1339
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Bilangan proses pelayan skrip serentak yang dijalankan bagi setiap proses spine.  Tetapan antara 1 dan 15 diterima.  Parameter ini akan membantu jika anda menjalankan beberapa thread dan skrip pelayan skrip dan hanya sah untuk Pengumpul Data spine."

#: include/global_settings.php:1346
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Nilai Tamat Masa Skrip dan Pelayan Skrip"

#: include/global_settings.php:1347
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Masa maksimum yang akan ditunggu oleh spine untuk skrip selesai.  Nilai tamat masa ini dalam saat dan hanya sah untuk Pengumpul Data spine."

#: include/global_settings.php:1354
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Indeks Semula Semua Peranti Berkala"

#: include/global_settings.php:1359
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Jadual Indeks Semula Semua Peranti"

#: include/global_settings.php:1360
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Pada kekerapan apakah anda ingin Mengindeks Semula semua Peranti.  Indeks Semula ini akan berlaku pada tengah malam pada kekerapan yang anda pilih."

#: include/global_settings.php:1366
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Mingguan pada hari Ahad"

#: include/global_settings.php:1367
msgid "Monthly on Sunady"
msgstr "Bulanan pada hari Ahad"

#: include/global_settings.php:1371
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Tamat Masa Latar Belakang dan Proses Serentak"

#: include/global_settings.php:1376
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Tamat Masa Penjanaan Laporan"

#: include/global_settings.php:1377
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Tempoh masa maksimum skrip Penjanaan Laporan Cacti boleh berjalan tanpa menjana ralat tamat masa dan ditamatkan."

