#: include/global_settings.php:2578
msgid "RRDfile Backup Directory"
msgstr "Direktori Sandaran RRDfile"

#: include/global_settings.php:2579
msgid "If this directory is not empty, then your original RRDfiles will be backed up to this location."
msgstr "Jika direktori ini tidak kosong, RRDfile asal anda akan disandarkan ke lokasi ini."

#: include/global_settings.php:2586
msgid "Batch Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Spike Kill Kelompok"

#: include/global_settings.php:2591
msgid "Removal Schedule"
msgstr "Jadual Pembuangan"

#: include/global_settings.php:2592
msgid "Do you wish to periodically remove spikes from your graphs?  If so, select the frequency below."
msgstr "Adakah anda ingin membuang lonjakan daripada graf anda secara berkala?  Jika ya, pilih kekerapan di bawah."

#: include/global_settings.php:2599
msgid "Once a Day"
msgstr "Sekali Sehari"

#: include/global_settings.php:2600
msgid "Every Other Day"
msgstr "Selang Sehari"

#: include/global_settings.php:2604
msgid "Base Time"
msgstr "Masa Asas"

#: include/global_settings.php:2605
msgid "The Base Time for Spike removal to occur.  For example, if you use '12:00am' and you choose once per day, the batch removal would begin at approximately midnight every day."
msgstr "Masa Asas untuk pembuangan lonjakan berlaku.  Contohnya, jika anda menggunakan '12:00am' dan memilih sekali sehari, pembuangan kelompok akan bermula pada kira-kira tengah malam setiap hari."

#: include/global_settings.php:2612
msgid "Graph Templates to Spike Kill"
msgstr "Templat Graf untuk Spike Kill"

#: include/global_settings.php:2614
msgid "When performing batch spike removal, only the templates selected below will be acted on."
msgstr "Apabila melakukan pembuangan lonjakan kelompok, hanya templat yang dipilih di bawah akan diproses."

#: include/global_settings.php:2618
msgid "Backup Retention"
msgstr "Pengekalan Sandaran"

#: include/global_settings.php:2619
msgid "When SpikeKill kills spikes in graphs, it makes a backup of the RRDfile.  How long should these backup files be retained?"
msgstr "Apabila SpikeKill membuang lonjakan dalam graf, ia membuat sandaran RRDfile.  Berapa lama fail sandaran ini patut dikekalkan?"

#: include/global_settings.php:2638
msgid "Default View Mode"
msgstr "Mod Paparan Lalai"

#: include/global_settings.php:2639
msgid "Which Graph mode you want displayed by default when you first visit the Graphs page?"
msgstr "Mod Graf yang mana anda mahu dipaparkan secara lalai apabila anda mula-mula melawat halaman Graf?"

#: include/global_settings.php:2645
msgid "TimeZone Support"
msgstr "Sokongan Zon Waktu"

#: include/global_settings.php:2646
msgid "How would you like Cacti to present dates?  This setting will also change the way that Cacti Graphs dates are represented."
msgstr "Bagaimana anda mahu Cacti memaparkan tarikh?  Tetapan ini juga akan mengubah cara tarikh Graf Cacti diwakili."

#: include/global_settings.php:2649
msgid "Cacti Server Timezone"
msgstr "Zon Waktu Pelayan Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php:2650
msgid "My Browsers Timezone"
msgstr "Zon Waktu Pelayar Saya"

#: include/global_settings.php:2655
msgid "User Language"
msgstr "Bahasa Pengguna"

#: include/global_settings.php:2656
msgid "Defines the preferred GUI language."
msgstr "Menentukan bahasa GUI pilihan."

#: include/global_settings.php:2662
msgid "Show Graph Title"
msgstr "Tunjukkan Tajuk Graf"

#: include/global_settings.php:2663
msgid "Display the graph title on the page so that it may be searched using the browser."
msgstr "Paparkan tajuk graf pada halaman supaya ia boleh dicari menggunakan pelayar."

#: include/global_settings.php:2668
msgid "Hide Disabled"
